        "items": [
          "The animals gather in the barn after Mr Jones goes to bed.",
          "Old Major explains that animals suffer because humans exploit them.",
          "Major describes a future where animals live free from man.",
          "The animals discuss rules and ideas about equality.",
          "Major teaches the animals 'Beasts of England'.",
          "Mr Jones fires his gun and the animals rush back to their beds."
